611
00:48:31,908 --> 00:48:33,076
Está bien.

612
00:48:58,101 --> 00:49:00,562
No lastimes a mis hijos.

613
00:49:23,794 --> 00:49:24,878
Oye.

614
00:49:42,312 --> 00:49:45,065
