629
00:51:03,977 --> 00:51:04,978
Cuidado.

630
00:51:05,103 --> 00:51:08,356
Tiene mal carácter.

631
00:51:38,261 --> 00:51:42,557
No. Esa mierda, no.

632
00:51:44,976 --> 00:51:46,770
No.

633
00:51:48,563 --> 00:51:49,648
Bien.

634
00:51:51,274 --> 00:51:53,151
